      "text": "Son of man shall come in the glory of his Father, Matt. 16:27 (25:31). what shall be the sign of thy coming, Matt. 24:3 (JS—M 1:4). then shall appear the sign of the Son of man, Matt. 24:30 (JS—M 1:36). of that day and hour knoweth no man, Matt. 24:36 (D&C 49:7). come in like manner as ye have seen him go, Acts 1:11. he shall send Jesus Christ, Acts 3:20. they that are Christ’s at his coming, 1 Cor. 15:23. Lord himself shall descend from heaven, 1 Thes. 4:16. Jesus shall be revealed from heaven, 2 Thes. 1:7. that Wicked … whom the Lord … shall destroy with the brightness of his coming, 2 Thes. 2:8. Lord will come as a thief in the night, 2 Pet. 3:10. Lord cometh with ten thousands of his saints, Jude 1:14. every eye shall see him, Rev. 1:7. I come quickly, Rev. 3:11 (2:5; 2:16; 22:7, 12, 20; D&C 33:18; 41:4; 54:10). great day of his wrath is come, Rev. 6:17. when he had opened the seventh seal, there was silence, Rev. 8:1.",
